Of course, I'm not naive to the limitations of telemedicine. I acknowledge that it may not be suitable for all patients, particularly those who require hands-on care or complex procedures. However, for many patients, telemedicine can be a safe and effective alternative to in-person consultations, and I believe it has the potential to revolutionize the way we deliver healthcare.<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>

