As a society, we need to acknowledge the potential harm caused by the "Free-to-play" model and consider implementing regulations to protect consumers, particularly children, from these exploitative practices. Game developers have a responsibility to prioritize fair and transparent monetization strategies that prioritize player well-being over profit.<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>

