Overall, I believe that stricter regulations on landlords are necessary to ensure that everyone has access to affordable and secure housing. It's time for us to rethink the way we approach housing and prioritize the needs of tenants over the interests of landlords.<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>

